       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (K, TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقِيمٌ</span></b> ,
